    "name": "astramod",
    "author": "Slashkig, IAmRustee, VoidThreader",
    "description": "\n[[]#ff0000]Aziris[[]] is a planet of breathtaking beauty and immense value, coveted by many factions for the rare and powerful [[]#bf2851]Erythronite Crystals[[]].\nFor centuries, Aziris has remained in the hands of the [[]blue]Sentinels[[]]. Now it is up to you to conquer this planet and seize its resources for yourself.\n\n-------\n\nThis is a WIP mod that adds a new planet, Aziris, with plenty of new content to explore.\nThere isn't a campaign yet, but all mod content can be checked out in sandbox, and you can join the discord for custom maps (and more!):\n\n[[]purple] https://discord.gg/2qc4WaCreP [[]]\n\nCurrently unavailable for mobile platforms, sorry :/\n",
